ogy-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1142/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g034\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“盤”字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1142/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g035\", \"description\": \"汉代印文/隶书“盤”字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1142/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n1182:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:001182\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 1182, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"b6646832cc4179131b9efe372cdd9eae4dcab864ac4f8fdac1f53a5cd455e99d\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"a3f21b6b5019e6cb778cf77961a4fe76b90c41db5c3ac163a3fdcc8464a86bc6\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_with_unidentified_printed_characters\"}, \"text\": \"蝠 蚕 蝙 蝠 蠻 閩 虹 蟒 蝀 蟋 螳 䖵 蚕\\n\\n前后两首蜿蜒向下之状。传说虹有两首,能下饮江河之水,甲骨文字正如比作。春秋籀文从虫,从申,申,电也。字形3为石鼓文,从虫,工声,奠定了后世“虹”字左形右声的格局。战国文字有一异构作[glyph:p001],从雨,工声,与从虫、工声的结构有异曲同工之妙。从虫者取其形象,从雨者取其成因。说明在战国时期,人们已经认识到,虹与雨水有关,虹是雨水折射太阳光而成的自然现象。但从雨作的“虹”字只是昙花一现,没有继续流传下来。从虫、工声的结构,后世还有左“工”右“虫”和上“工”下“虫”两种异体,前者见于马王堆帛书和《集韵》,后者收录于《正字通》等书,均比较少见。“虹”指的是大气中一种光的现象,即天空中的小水珠经日光照射和反射作用而形成的弧形彩带,由外圈至内圈呈红、橙、黄、绿、青、靛、紫七种颜色。出现在和太阳相对着的方向。《说文》:“虹,螮蝀也,状似虫。”《殷虚书契菁华》四:“亦有出虹自北,饮于河。”弧形的彩虹似拱桥,故又喻指桥。读hòng,通“讧”。祸乱。《诗·大雅·抑》:“彼童而角,实虹小子。”郑笺:“此人实溃乱小子之政。”联绵词“虹洞”,相连的样子。《文选·枚乘〈七发〉》:“虹洞兮苍天,极虑乎崖涘。”李善注:“虹洞,相连貌也。”(林志强)\\n\\n螮(蝃) dì 端组、月部;端组、霁韵、都计切。\\n[glyph:g001]¹ 《说文》小篆 螮 楷书\\n[glyph:g002] 蝃 楷书\\n1《说文》283页。\\n形声字。从虫,带声。又作“蝃”,二者为声符不同的异体字。“螮”与“蝀”构成复音词“螮蝀”,指彩虹。《说文》:“螮,螮蝀,虹也。”《晋书·夏统传》:“螮蝀之气见,君子尚不敢指。”(林志强)\\n\\n蝀 dōng 端组、东部;端组、东韵、德红切。\\n[glyph:g003]¹ 《说文》小篆 蝀 楷书\\n1《说文》283页。\\n形声字。从虫,束声。根据简化字偏旁类推的原则,此字当可简化作“虫东”,殆因罕用之故,《简化字总表》未收。“蝀”是螮蝀的省称,指虹。《说文》:“蝀,螮蝀也。”《徐霞客游记·游白岳山日记》:“飞虹垂蝀,下空恰如半月。”(参见“螮”字条)(林志强)\\n\\n蟋 xī 心组、质部;心组、质韵、息七切。\\n[glyph:g004]¹ 《说文》新附 [glyph:g005]² 汉 蟋 楷书\\n1《说文》283页。2《甲金篆》928页。\\n形声字。从虫,悉声。清钮树玉《说文新附考》:“《说文》蚩训悉蚩,知悉古无虫旁。然《隶释》载《石经》鲁《诗》残碑已作蟋蟀。”按碑上“蟋”字声旁“悉”从“米”,少了上面一撇,乃隶变所致。“蟋”与“蟀”构成复音词“蟋蟀”,是一种昆虫名。《说文》:“蟋,蟋蟀也。”《诗·唐风·蟋蟀》:“蟋蟀在唐,岁聿其莫。”(参见“蜚”字条)(林志强)\\n\\n螳 táng 定组、阳部;定组、唐韵、徒郎切。\\n[glyph:g006]¹ 《说文》新附 螳 楷书\\n1《说文》283页。\\n形声字。从虫,堂声。“螳”即“螳娘(螳螂)”,一种昆虫名。《说文》:“螳,螳娘也。”汉王逸《九思·哀岁》:“巷有兮蚰蜒,邑多兮螳螂。”参见“娘(螂)”字条。(林志强)\\n\\n䖵部\\n\\n䖵 kūn 见组、文部;见组、魂韵、古浑切。\\n[glyph:g007]¹ 商 [glyph:g008]² 商 [glyph:g009]³ 战国 [glyph:g010]⁴ 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g011]⁵ 秦 䖵 楷书\\n1、2《甲文编》510页。3《金文编》876页。\\n4《说文》283页。5《睡甲》198页。\\n会意字。从二虫。是“锟”的初文,即昆虫之“昆”的本字。“䖵”是虫类的总称。《说文》:“䖵,虫之总名也。”段玉裁注:“虫之总名称烛。凡经传言昆虫即烛虫也。”汉许冲《上〈说文解字〉书》:“慎博问通人,考之于逵,作《说文》,六艺群书之诂,皆训其意,而天地鬼神、山川艸木、鸟兽虫虫,杂物奇怪、王制礼仪、世间人事,莫不毕载。”(林志强)\\n\\n蠶(蚕) cán 从组、侵部;从组、覃韵、昨含切。\\n1167\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1182/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1182/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1182/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"p001\", \"description\": \"Printed character with 雨 on top and 工 on the bottom\", \"kind\": \"unidentified_printed_character\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1182/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"Small seal script of 螮, consisting of 虫 and 帶\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1182/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"Arrow diagram connector for variant 蝃\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1182/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"Small seal script of 蝀, consisting of 虫 and 東\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1182/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"Seal script form of 蟋 from 《说文》新附\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1182/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"Han dynasty clerical script of 蟋\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1182/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"Seal script form of 螳 from 《说文》新附\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1182/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"Oracle bone script form 1 of 䖵\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1182/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"Oracle bone script form 2 of 䖵\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1182/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"Warring States script form of 䖵\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1182/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"Small seal script of 䖵 from 《说文》\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1182/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"Qin slip character of 䖵 from Shuihudi\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1182/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [\"p001: The printed character composed of 雨 above and 工 below is represented by p001.\"], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n1219:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:001219\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 1219, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"8adbd64cf4bc8e16c9446a2b36cb0787504e9bde6dda14e45bcc29bfe0c0a74c\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"44efe7836ba04d604d02d2c888743d5294b747f0437080ba2b8ccd26b0c87b82\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"田部 畕部 黄部 男部\\n\\n上·田部。\\n\\n形声字。从田,童声。异体作疃,声符误从重,乃隶变所致。“曈”指禽兽践踏的地方,即“町疃”。《说文》:“曈,禽兽所践处也。”《诗·豳风·东山》:“町疃鹿场,熠燿宵行。”今本“曈”作“疃”。又指村庄、屯。唐彦谦《夏日访友》:“孤舟唤野渡,村曈入幽邃。”(林志强)\\n\\n旸 chàng 透组、阳部;彻组、漾韵、丑亮切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001]¹—[glyph:g002]²—[glyph:g003]³—[glyph:g004]⁴—旸\\n《说文》小篆 秦 汉 汉 楷书\\n\\\\ [glyph:g005]⁵—畅—畅\\n汉 楷书 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》291页。2睡虎地秦墓竹简《秦律十八种图版·一》15页。3《马王堆》558页。4、5《甲金篆》第959页。\\n\\n形声字。从田,昜声。隶书“田”旁中画延伸变为“申”,遂形成通畅之“畅”。“昜”旁简化为“𠃓”,“暢”也类推为“畅”。“旸”的本义是田荒芜不生谷物。《说文》:“旸,不生也。”睡虎地秦墓竹简《秦律》:“雨为澍,及诱粟,辄以书言澍稼、诱粟及狠田暘毋稼者顷数。”借为“暢(畅)”。徐铉云:“臣铉等曰,借为通暢之暘,今俗别作暢。”段玉裁注:“旸,今之畅,盖即此字之隶变。”“畅”字的基本义指通、达。《易·坤》:“美在其中,而畅于四支。”引申为舒展、充实、旺盛、欢快、尽情等。(林志强)\\n\\n由 yóu 喻组、幽部;以组、尤韵、以周切。\\n\\n[glyph:g006]¹ \\\\ [glyph:g007]⁶—[glyph:g008]⁹ \\\\\\n商 汉 汉 \\\\\\n[glyph:g009]²—[glyph:g010]³—[glyph:g011]⁴—[glyph:g012]⁵—[glyph:g013]⁷—[glyph:g014]¹⁰—由\\n商 西周 《说文》古文 《说文》小篆 汉 汉 楷书\\n/ [glyph:g015]⁸—[glyph:g016]¹¹—由\\n汉 汉 楷书\\n\\n1、2《甲骨文字典》1395页。3《金文编》847页。4、5《说文》268页。6、11《金文续编》280页。7-10《甲金篆》959页。\\n\\n象形字。像缶之形。《说文》无“由”字,其“留”字实即“由”字。“甾”字上部三曲画当是此字古文字形三竖画上突部分的隶变讹写。汉代以后字形变化可分三种情况:一如字形6、9,三竖画都通上,犹存古形;二如字形7、10,左右竖画不通上,此种写法发展成为现代汉字的规范写法;三如字形8、11,中间竖画通上,但不连下。“由”的本义是缶,《说文·甾部》:“甾(zāi),东楚名缶曰甾。”缶为日常用品,故引申为用。《书·君陈》:“既见圣,亦不克由圣。”假借为“鬯”,树木生出枝条。《说文·𠚪部》:“鬯,木生条也。”《书·盘庚上》:“若颠木之有由蘗,天其永我命于兹新邑。”泛指萌生。引申为来源、开头、原由、缘故、经由、经历等,从经由、经历再引申为践履、遵从等。虚化为介词,相当于“自”、“从”、“因为”、“由于”等。通“犹”,如同。《孟子·梁惠王上》:“民归之,由水之就下。”(林志强)\\n\\n畕部\\n\\n畕 jiāng 见组、阳部;见组、阳韵、居良切。\\n\\n[glyph:g017]¹—[glyph:g018]²—[glyph:g019]³—[glyph:g020]⁴—畕\\n商 西周 战国 《说文》小篆 楷书\\n\\n1《甲骨文字典》1474页。2《金文编》894页。3《甲金篆》959页。4《说文》291页。\\n\\n会意字。从二田,表示田与田相连。“畕”同“畺(疆)”。本义是田界。《说文》:“畕,比田也。”《正字通》:“畕,疆本字……或作畺,俗作疆。”参见“畺(疆)”字条。(林志强)\\n\\n畺(疆)\\njiāng 见组、阳部;见组、阳韵、居良切。\\n\\n1204\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“旸”字，左田右昜\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"秦代简帛“旸”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"汉代“旸”字（左田右昜）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"汉代“旸”字，结构偏向楷书\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"汉代“畅”字异体，左申右昜/𠃓\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“由”字，像缶形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"汉代“由”字异体（形6），三竖画均通上\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"汉代“由”字异体（形9），三竖画均通上\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“由”字（形2）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"西周金文“由”字（形3）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"《说文》古文“由”字（形4）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“由”字（形5）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"汉代“由”字（形7），左右竖不通上\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"汉代“由”字（形10），左右竖不通上\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"汉代“由”字（形8），中间竖通上但不连下\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"汉代“由”字（形11），中间竖通上但不连下\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“畕”字，上下两田叠置\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"西周金文“畕”字，上下两田叠置\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"战国文字“畕”字，上下两田叠置\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“畕”字，上下两田相连叠置\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1219/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n1292:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:001292\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 1292, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"58d8ab876966db5c77bd864edc3259d02f516f553d03212f5362e79962d94776\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"d48149e84fee865f53842741803be71fecc4ce39b3024f94f1c1bb2e6446664b\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"辜 辭 辡 辯 辩 辯\\n\\n[glyph:g002]²\\n西周\\n\\n[glyph:g001]¹\\n商\\n\\n[glyph:g003]³\\n西周\\n\\n[glyph:g004]⁴  [glyph:g005]⁵  [glyph:g006]⁶\\n西周  春秋  战国\\n\\n[glyph:g007]⁷——[glyph:g008]⁸——辭——辞\\n秦    汉    楷书   楷书\\n\\n1-6《类编》251页。 7、8《篆隶表》1054页。\\n\\n会意字。从𤔔，从辛。“𤔔”是“乱”的本字，有“治理”的意思；“辛”代表刑法，会合起来就是“以法律理纷乱”，也就是“诉讼”的意思。这是“辭”的本义。“辭”字最早出现于甲骨文中，作“[glyph:g009]”，字的左边是一只手在整理线轴，右边是辛。金文中出现多种异体：除了都在左侧添加另一只手之外，还有添加“口”或“言”旁以使“辩讼”义更鲜明的；还有一种将“辛”替换成“司”的，“司”有“治理”的意思，而且古音中“司”与“辞”同属“之”部，所以这个字就成为会意兼形声字。但所有这些异体都没有被小篆采纳，小篆基本上沿袭了甲骨文的构形，只在左半边采纳了金文中双手理丝的构形。隶定后左侧像线轴之形的部分拉长，将下方的部分罩住，而原先像丝线之形的部分被分割成了上下两半，楷书写作“辭”，简化后与“辝”字异体“辞”同形。本义是诉讼。《说文》：“辭，讼也。从𤔔，𤔔犹理辜也。”徐灏注笺：“凡有说以告于人者谓之辭。”朱骏声通训定声：“辭，纷争辩讼谓之辭。”引申为讼辞。《书·吕刑》：“民之乱，罔不中听狱之两辞。”孔传：“民之所以治，由典狱之无不以中正听狱之两辞。”两辞即原告与被告的控辩与答辩。又《周礼·秋官·乡士》：“听其狱讼，察其辞。”再引申为言辞、文辞。《荀子·正名》：“心合于道，说合于心，辞合于说。”讼辞中常常为求无罪而找借口，故又可引申为借口。再者，诉讼是为了摆脱罪名，所以“辞”又有推辞、辞却等引申义，而且这一系列义项以及言辞、文辞等引申义逐渐成为“辞”的常用义。(王颖)\\n\\n辡 部\\n\\n辡 biàn 并组、元部；并组、弥韵、符蹇切。\\n\\n[glyph:g010]¹——辡\\n《说文》小篆   楷书\\n\\n1《说文》309页。\\n\\n会意字。从二辛。本义是辩解、争辩。《说文》：“辡，罪人相与讼也。”饶炯《部首订》：“辡，即争辩本字，谓罪人互讼，争论曲直，各自疏解其事，故从二辛见义。盖辩为罪人自辩其非。”争辩需要好的口才，故“辡”的引申义是“有口才”，这一义项与本义均为后起的“辩”字继承。“辡”字仅见于《说文》，而且并未有文例证明它能单独成字，疑为许慎从“辩”、“辨”等字中抽取归纳出来，立为部首的，《说文》中有不少这样的例子。这样就不能说“辡”是“辩”的本字，或“辩”是“辡”的后起字，因为“辡”本不成字。而且除《说文》外，其他字书都把“辩”、“辨”等字分别归入“言”、“刀”等部，这样“辡”作为部首也不存在了。(王颖)\\n\\n辩(辯) biàn 并组、元部；并组、弥韵、符蹇切。\\n\\n[glyph:g013]³\\n汉\\n\\n[glyph:g014]⁴——[glyph:g015]⁵\\n汉       汉\\n\\n[glyph:g011]¹——[glyph:g012]²——辯——辩\\n秦    《说文》小篆   楷书   楷书\\n\\n1、3、4、5《篆隶表》1055页。2《说文》309页。\\n\\n会意字。从言，从二辛。“辛”代表罪人，“言”表示言辞，两罪人以言辞相向，即互讼、争辩之义。“辩”字最早见于睡虎地秦简，呈上下结构，作“[glyph:g016]”，《说文》小篆则是把“言”插入“辡”之间。此后结构基本不再变化，仅在个别笔画处有微小的调整，直至楷书。汉字简化时将中间的“言”变为“讠”，“辩”就成为了“辩”了。本义为争辩。《墨子·经上》：“辩，争彼(彼，指论题)也。辩胜，当也。”争辩是为了分清对错，并纠正错误，所以可引申为辩正、纠正的意思。《礼记·曾子问》：“康子拜稽颡于位，有司弗辩也。”孔颖达疏：“有司，谓当时执事之有司，畏季子之威，不敢辩正。”而在上者由争辩以决是非，故引申为治理。《说文》：“辩，治也。”段玉裁注：“治者，理也。”《管子·五辅》：“大夫任官辩事，官长任事守职。”能治事、决是非者必聪明，故“辩”又引申为慧、聪明的意。思《史\\n1277\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"甲骨文“辭”字，左部为手理乱丝形，右部为辛\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"西周金文“辭”字，双手理丝形，右部为辛\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"西周金文“辭”字异体，从司\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"西周金文“辭”字异体，加口旁\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"春秋金文“辭”字异体，从言\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"战国文字“辭”字异体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"秦代小篆体“辭”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“辭”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"文中引述的甲骨文“辭”字构形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“辡”字，从二辛相向\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"睡虎地秦简“辯”字，上下结构，上二辛下言\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“辯”字，二辛夹言\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“辯”字形体1\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“辯”字形体2\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“辯”字形体3\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"文中引述的睡虎地秦简“辯”字形体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1292/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
