{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"web_search","id":"exec-27570d56-1314-4609-bb66-f67e13cff3e7","query":"","action":{"type":"other"},"results":[{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.thepaper.cn","ref_id":"turn6view0","snippet":"Total lines: 165","title":"傅斯年讲座︱林沄：神权、军权与族权，商王最重视哪个权力_私家历史_澎湃新闻-The Paper","url":"https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_1602617"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"ephpth.ephhk.com","ref_id":"turn6view1","snippet":"Total lines: 22","title":"字源考釋 - 比","url":"https://ephpth.ephhk.com/resource/tools/lcprichi/search/show_word.php?id=1426"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"humanum.arts.cuhk.edu.hk","ref_id":"turn6view2","snippet":"Total lines: 239","title":"漢語多功能字庫","url":"https://humanum.arts.cuhk.edu.hk/Lexis/lexi-mf/search.php?word=%E6%AF%94"}]}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"evidence\":[{\"source\":\"李學勤主編《字源》; direct inspection of attached scan /home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0738/source.png\",\"field\":\"比部; PDF p. 738, printed p. 725; 比 headword, glyph sequence and account; continuation checked on PDF p. 739, printed p. 726\",\"text\":\"The printed headword is 比. The entry labels forms 商、西周、《說文》古文、秦、《說文》小篆、漢 and 楷書, and describes its main line as retaining a two-匕 construction from Shang–Zhou through small seal, with an exception among the ancient forms. It says clerical transformation straightened the strokes and obscured their pictorial quality. I inspected both attached page images; p. 726 begins 北部 and does not continue 比. The printed page numbers 725 and 726 are visible in the scans. Edition metadata is identified separately by the linked catalogue; it does not support the interpretation.\",\"record_character\":\"比\",\"kind\":\"locally_inspected_scholarly_book\",\"url\":\"https://books.google.com/books/about/%E5%AD%97%E6%BA%90.html?id=xqP9zAEACAAJ\",\"title\":\"字源, Volume 3 — Google Books bibliographic record\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"李學勤主編《字源》; direct inspection of attached scan /home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0738/source.png\",\"field\":\"比部; PDF p. 738, printed p. 725; 董莲池’s formation and meaning account\",\"text\":\"董莲池 proposes an ideographic construction from two 匕, described as ancient shallow, long-handled food ladles with pointed ends. The entry says juxtaposing them expresses nearness or adjacency and explicitly says 匕 also cues the pronunciation. It treats “密也” from Shuowen as semantically compatible but rejects Shuowen’s two-person/reversed-从 analysis. It proposes extension from adjacency/nearness to union, factional association and comparison, and cites a Shang oracle-bone phrase 王比望乘伐下危 as using 比 for union. These are the author’s analyses, not independently settled conclusions. The exact printed component named in the sound clause is 匕.\",\"record_character\":\"比\",\"kind\":\"locally_inspected_scholarly_book\",\"url\":\"https://books.google.com/books/about/%E5%AD%97%E6%BA%90.html?id=xqP9zAEACAAJ\",\"title\":\"字源, Volume 3 — Google Books bibliographic record\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"李學勤主編《字源》; direct inspection of attached scan /home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0738/source.png\",\"field\":\"比部; PDF p. 738, printed p. 725; cited examples and semantic interpretation\",\"text\":\"The entry cites 《詩·周頌·良耜》“其比如栉” for its proposed adjacency sense; an oracle-bone phrase “辛酉卜，争贞：王比望乘伐下危？” for union; 《论语·为政》“君子周而不比” for factional association; and 《左传·昭公二十八年》 for comparison. This documents the book’s semantic analysis and examples, not a securely dated chain of semantic development. Its graphic-sequence references are 《甲金篆》 p. 571 and 《说文》 p. 169.\",\"record_character\":\"比\",\"kind\":\"locally_inspected_scholarly_book\",\"url\":\"https://books.google.com/books/about/%E5%AD%97%E6%BA%90.html?id=xqP9zAEACAAJ\",\"title\":\"字源, Volume 3 — Google Books bibliographic record\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"Xu Shen, 說文解字, 比部, quoted in Taiwan Ministry of Education Dictionary of Chinese Character Variants\",\"field\":\"說文釋形; historical dictionary analysis\",\"text\":\"The Ministry’s entry reproduces the Shuowen account “密也。二人為从，反从為比” and records readings bì, bǐ and pí. This verifies the transmitted Han dictionary analysis as a historical account, not its accuracy as an explanation of the Shang graph.\",\"record_character\":\"比\",\"kind\":\"official_dictionary_record\",\"url\":\"https://dict.variants.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=23088&q=1\",\"title\":\"[A02102] 比 — 教育部《異體字字典》\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"Hong Kong Education Bureau, 字源考釋\",\"field\":\"字形解說; competing person-form interpretation\",\"text\":\"This educational reference describes oracle, bronze and small-seal forms of 比 as two people facing right and close together. It provides a contrasting person-form interpretation, but its textual description alone does not establish the ancient signs’ identity.\",\"record_character\":\"比\",\"kind\":\"educational_character_entry\",\"url\":\"https://ephpth.ephhk.com/resource/tools/lcprichi/search/show_word.php?id=1426\",\"title\":\"字源考釋 - 比\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"漢語多功能字庫, Chinese University of Hong Kong\",\"field\":\"形義通解; graphic analysis and early uses\",\"text\":\"The entry interprets oracle-bone and bronze 比 as two 人 forms side by side and distinguishes it from 从 by the usual direction of the figures and a more curved lower part in 比, attributing that distinction to 屈萬里. It also reports oracle-bone uses read as 妣 and an “assist/support” interpretation of 王比望乘, citing 李宗焜. These are the dictionary’s reported analyses and readings; they contrast with 字源’s two-匕 proposal and do not independently resolve the graph’s composition.\",\"record_character\":\"比\",\"kind\":\"scholarly_dictionary_entry\",\"url\":\"https://humanum.arts.cuhk.edu.hk/Lexis/lexi-mf/search.php?word=%E6%AF%94\",\"title\":\"漢語多功能字庫 — 比\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"林沄 lecture report, The Paper\",\"field\":\"reported paleographic and syntactic analysis\",\"text\":\"A report of Lin Yun’s 2016 lecture says Lin distinguished 比 from 从 in oracle-bone graph forms and syntax, connected 比’s changes with 妣, and argued for an 匕-related analysis. The report presents Lin’s attributed argument, not an independent inspection of the cited early specimens.\",\"record_character\":\"比\",\"kind\":\"secondary_report_of_scholarly_analysis\",\"url\":\"https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_1602617\",\"title\":\"傅斯年讲座︱林沄：神权、军权与族权，商王最重视哪个权力\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"李宗焜, “卜辭中的「望乘」——兼釋「比」的辭意,” 《古文字與古代史》第一輯 (2007), p. 117; Academia Sinica abstract\",\"field\":\"early Shang use and disputed lexical interpretation\",\"text\":\"Li describes competing interpretations of 王比望乘, including “follow” or “lead” and “close alliance.” He argues instead for “assist/support,” possibly by supplying people and materials for a campaign. This establishes a material disagreement over the phrase’s sense; it does not settle the general semantic history of 比.\",\"record_character\":\"比\",\"kind\":\"scholarly_article_abstract\",\"url\":\"https://www1.ihp.sinica.edu.tw/storage/publishBookItem/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E8%BC%AF_06%E6%9D%8E%E5%AE%97%E7%84%9C_%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81.pdf\",\"title\":\"卜辭中的「望乘」——兼釋「比」的辭意\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"Baxter and Sagart, Old Chinese reconstruction table, version 1.1 (2014), accessed PDF p. 70\",\"field\":\"Old Chinese and Middle Chinese entry for 匕\",\"text\":\"The table separately lists 匕 bǐ, MC pjijX, OC *pijʔ, with glosses “ladle, spoon” and “spoon.” These are the table’s reconstructed and Middle Chinese forms, not direct recordings of an ancient pronunciation and not proof that 匕 is a component of 比.\",\"record_character\":\"匕\",\"kind\":\"primary_reconstruction_table\",\"url\":\"https://sites.lsa.umich.edu/ocbaxtersagart/wp-content/uploads/sites/1415/2025/03/BaxterSagartOCbyRadStr2014-09-20.pdf\",\"title\":\"Baxter-Sagart Old Chinese reconstruction, version 1.1 (13 September 2014)\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"Baxter and Sagart, Old Chinese reconstruction table, version 1.1 (2014), accessed PDF p. 71\",\"field\":\"Old Chinese and Middle Chinese entries for 比\",\"text\":\"The table lists 比 bǐ, MC pjijX, OC *C.pijʔ, glossed “compare,” and separately 比 bì, MC pjijH, OC *pij-s, glossed “combine; all.” Against 匕 *pijʔ, the bǐ entries share the rhyme and coda in this system but differ in the reconstructed onset notation; similarity alone does not demonstrate a phonetic role. This record concerns 比’s readings and does not transfer the host pronunciation to 匕.\",\"record_character\":\"比\",\"kind\":\"primary_reconstruction_table\",\"url\":\"https://sites.lsa.umich.edu/ocbaxtersagart/wp-content/uploads/sites/1415/2025/03/BaxterSagartOCbyRadStr2014-09-20.pdf\",\"title\":\"Baxter-Sagart Old Chinese reconstruction, version 1.1 (13 September 2014)\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"}],\"search_audit\":[{\"query\":\"比 字 甲骨文 王比望乘 联合 释义 李宗焜 甲骨文 比 辅助 论文\",\"urls\":[\"https://www1.ihp.sinica.edu.tw/storage/publishBookItem/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E8%BC%AF_06%E6%9D%8E%E5%AE%97%E7%84%9C_%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81.pdf\",\"https://www1.ihp.sinica.edu.tw/jp/Publications/Bulletin/861/Article/1658\",\"https://edt.cqvip.com/journal/jgwc/article/1455741318\"],\"outcome\":\"Search located Li Zongkun’s abstract, a bibliographic record for Qu Wanli’s 1948 article and a recent article result. Opened Li’s abstract and read its competing interpretations. Qu’s page timed out; CQVIP returned a cache miss, so neither was used as read evidence.\"},{\"query\":\"比 character oracle bone script two 匕 people etymology paleography academic 比 从 甲骨文\",\"urls\":[\"https://www1.ihp.sinica.edu.tw/jp/Publications/Bulletin/861/Article/1658\",\"https://edt.cqvip.com/journal/jgwc/article/1455741318\",\"https://toaj.stpi.niar.org.tw/index/journal/volume/article/4b1141f9917320a501918ca66f59075d\"],\"outcome\":\"Search returned the Sinica article record and abstracts/snippets concerning 匕 and 人 analyses. The Sinica article timed out; CQVIP and TOAJ article pages could not be opened. Search snippets were not used as evidence.\"},{\"query\":\"site:ctext.org \\\"比\\\" \\\"密也\\\" 二人爲从 反从爲比\",\"urls\":[\"https://ctext.org/shuo-wen-jie-zi/bi-bu5/zh\"],\"outcome\":\"Search returned the Shuowen transcription, but the page open failed. The Shuowen wording was instead inspected in the Ministry of Education dictionary record.\"},{\"query\":\"site:unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl 比 6BD4 kMandarin\",\"urls\":[\"https://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?codepoint=6BD4\"],\"outcome\":\"Attempted the official Unihan codepoint page; it failed to open. No Unihan reading claim is made.\"},{\"query\":\"\\\"甲骨文从比二字辨\\\" 屈萬里 1948 比 匕 PDF\",\"urls\":[\"https://www1.ihp.sinica.edu.tw/jp/Publications/Bulletin/861/Article/1658\",\"https://www1.ihp.sinica.edu.tw/Publications/Bulletin/861\",\"https://lawdata.com.tw/tw/detail.aspx?no=496836\"],\"outcome\":\"Search confirmed bibliographic metadata for Qu Wanli’s 1948 article, pp. 213–217, but did not yield an accessible copy of its argument. The Sinica article page timed out.\"},{\"query\":\"\\\"比\\\" \\\"匕\\\" \\\"从二匕\\\" 甲骨文 古文字 学术\",\"urls\":[\"https://edt.cqvip.com/journal/jgwc/article/1455741318\",\"https://www1.ihp.sinica.edu.tw/jp/Publications/Bulletin/861/Article/1658\"],\"outcome\":\"Search results surfaced a recent article abstract favoring a two-匕 analysis and the Qu Wanli record. The recent article page was inaccessible; these snippets were not treated as inspected scholarship.\"},{\"query\":\"李學勤 字源 2012 天津古籍出版社 辽宁人民出版社 ISBN 9787552800692 catalogue\",\"urls\":[\"https://books.google.com/books/about/%E5%AD%97%E6%BA%90.html?id=xqP9zAEACAAJ\",\"https://hotbook.nbt.edu.cn/nbt/?id=105597&what=detail\",\"https://opac.sdx.sh.cn/ILASOPAC/NTRdrBookRetr.do?LeftPubyearKey=2012&LeftPubyearType=pubyear&LeftSubjectKey=%E6%B1%89%E5%AD%97&LeftSubjectType=subject&LeftTypeKey=0&LeftTypeType=type&PageNum=10&ResearchSearchType=null&SearchKey=%E6%B1%89%E2%80%A6%E2%80%A6&SearchType=text&leftPublishKey=%E5%A4%A9%E6%B4%A5%E5%8F%A4%E7%B1%8D%E5%87%BA%E7%89%88%E7%A4%BE&leftPublishType=publish&researchSearchKey=null&searchWay=searchWayPrv\"],\"outcome\":\"Opened bibliographic/catalogue records confirming title, editor, publisher, 2012 and ISBN 9787552800692. These records identify the publication only; the page claims come from direct scan inspection.\"},{\"query\":\"site:ihp.sinica.edu.tw \\\"卜辭中的「望乘」\\\" 李宗焜 比 輔助\",\"urls\":[\"https://www1.ihp.sinica.edu.tw/storage/publishBookItem/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E8%BC%AF_06%E6%9D%8E%E5%AE%97%E7%84%9C_%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81.pdf\",\"https://www1.ihp.sinica.edu.tw/Publications/Book/561\"],\"outcome\":\"Opened Li’s abstract and the author bibliography. The abstract directly presents “assist/support” against earlier “follow/lead” and “alliance” readings.\"},{\"query\":\"林沄 比 甲骨文 从二人 甲骨文中的商代方国联盟 比 两个匕 字形\",\"urls\":[\"https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_1602617\",\"https://dict.variants.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=23088&q=1\",\"https://humanum.arts.cuhk.edu.hk/Lexis/lexi-mf/search.php?word=%E6%AF%94\"],\"outcome\":\"Opened the lecture report, Ministry dictionary and CUHK character dictionary. The lecture report attributes an 匕-related analysis to Lin Yun; the CUHK dictionary presents a competing 人-form account and reports early uses. The Ministry entry preserves the Shuowen account.\"},{\"query\":\"比 字 早期 字形 两人相背 说文 二人为从 反从为比 学术\",\"urls\":[\"https://dict.variants.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=23088&q=1\",\"https://humanum.arts.cuhk.edu.hk/Lexis/lexi-mf/search.php?word=%E6%AF%94\",\"https://www.shuowen5.com/%E6%AF%94_zi/\"],\"outcome\":\"Search returned the Ministry and CUHK pages, which were opened and inspected, plus a Shuowen secondary page that was not used.\"}],\"gaps\":[\"Qu Wanli’s cited 1948 article, “甲骨文从比二字辨” (《中央研究院歷史語言研究所集刊》13, pp. 213–217), was found bibliographically but its page timed out; its detailed argument was not inspected.\",\"The exact lexical interpretation of the Shang oracle-bone phrase 王比望乘 remains disputed: the inspected accounts report follow/lead, alliance or union, and assist/support. The proposed extensions from adjacency to union, factional association and comparison are stated mechanisms in 字源, but the inspected evidence does not establish their dates or a chronological chain.\",\"字源 explicitly assigns a sound-cue role to 匕, and Baxter–Sagart gives similar rhyme/coda values for 匕 *pijʔ and 比 *C.pijʔ. The sound similarity does not by itself verify 匕’s component status; the host’s *C- notation differs from 匕’s reconstruction.\",\"The official Unicode Unihan page for 比 was attempted but inaccessible. No current Mandarin sound comparison is used here.\",\"No OCR discrepancy requiring correction was confirmed in the inspected 比 passage on PDF p. 738 / printed p. 725 or the adjacent page p. 739 / printed p. 726.\"]}"}}
